# Fredrinn, Rogue Appraiser

> Fredrinn reads as a tank with damage scaling, but that framing hides the real mechanic. He is a delayed-reaction bruiser whose entire sustain engine runs on what the enemy team throws at him. If they refuse to commit damage, his Crystal Energy never stacks and the kit collapses into a mediocre taunt bot.

