## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.95 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Objective Tank (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Cursed Helmet, Thunder Belt, Guardian Helmet, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Cursed Helmet, Thunder Belt, Guardian Helmet
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Seasoned Hunter, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy draft is mostly physical and control duration is not stopping Fredrinn from landing S2 into S3.; Dominance Ice over Oracle when Use against attack-speed carries, healer drafts, or shield-heavy front lines that must hit Fredrinn during objective fights.; Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use when one burst mage can front-load enough magic damage to remove Fredrinn before Crystal Energy converts back.; Radiant Armor over Oracle when Use against repeated magic ticks that stack through Lord and Turtle dances instead of one burst combo.
- Total cost: 10910 gold

Default jungle setup for first-contact objective fights where Cursed Helmet speeds clear, Thunder Belt locks targets, and Guardian Helmet keeps Fredrinn healthy between contests.

### Jungle Bruiser Sustain (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Thunder Belt, Queen's Wings, Brute Force Breastplate, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Thunder Belt, Queen's Wings
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Seasoned Hunter, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Cursed Helmet over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when your first clear is being punished and the team needs faster camp tempo before the second Turtle.; Dominance Ice over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when sustain fighters or attack-speed marksmen are forced to keep hitting Fredrinn in extended fights.; Oracle over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when fights last long enough for Crystal Energy conversion, Brave Smite, and Queen's Wings sustain to decide the second rotation.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use against front-loaded magic burst when surviving the first spell chain matters more than a late revive.
- Total cost: 10860 gold

Bruiser jungle setup for games where Fredrinn can trade damage back instead of only soaking, with War Axe and Queen's Wings feeding longer brawls.

### EXP Vengeance Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, War Axe, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when magic poke, slows, or chain control are the reason Fredrinn cannot spend Combo Points cleanly.; Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use against physical skill fighters or assassins who repeatedly hit Fredrinn before his taunt refresh begins.; Radiant Armor over Oracle when Use against repeated magic damage that chips Fredrinn before Vengeance and Appraiser's Wrath can swing the fight.; Guardian Helmet over Immortality when Use when side-lane resets and repeated siege defenses matter more than a single resurrection timer.
- Total cost: 10630 gold

EXP lane variant for drafts that already have a jungler and need Fredrinn to absorb the first spell cycle with Vengeance before turning the fight.

